) so we can jump straight on it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/waleed_khalid\"\u003e@Waleed_Khalid\u003c/a\u003e, this sounds like a separate issue, and “IDE bot” makes me think it’s the Cursor editor rather than the Grok Bot app. Could you open a new thread describing what happens when you send a message (and a Request ID if it’s the Cursor IDE)? We’ll pick it up there.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-24T07:05:21.466Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":15.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":172797,"topic_slug":"chief-of-staff-gone-silent-and-wont-stop-previous-turn","display_username":"Mohit","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":103596,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/chief-of-staff-gone-silent-and-wont-stop-previous-turn/172797/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":500082,"name":"Waleed Khalid","username":"Waleed_Khalid","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/w/94ad74/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-24T15:10:20.892Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks a lot, Mohit, for replying.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe issue is not only with the Grok bot 